Bind Npc 29070 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 29071 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 784 "[Crack of All Means] The best medicine for a maniac is a club."
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Gater."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Knocker."
    Collect 4 of 900321000
    Collect 1 of 900322000

Requires player level >= 52 and quest 783 is completed

Rewards
    Give 7500000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Herga has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Nez has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Because of Herga, we're seeing some progress."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Since we have the [Haoong Clan Blood Sample] I need something that'll can be compaired with. I'll send you to a place where you can collect [Contaminated Haoong's Warrior Blood], [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood].\n\nCollect [Contaminated Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] and [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood] from where Gator is sending you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Because of Nez, we're seeing some progress."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Since we have the [Haoong Clan Blood Sample] I need something that'll can be compaired with. I'll send you to a place where you can collect [Contaminated Haoong's Warrior Blood], [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood].\n\nCollect [Contaminated Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] and [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood] from where Noker is sending you."

On in_progress
    Say "I don't think you have enough. Go collect more."
    Topic "[Enter Dungeon]" do
        Enter instance 81 set 2 at 204 197

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You have them all! I'll start experiement.\n\nFind Herga. I've sent the contamination report. He says he'll need to talk to you, <selfname>."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You have them all! I'll start experiement.\n\nFind Nez. I've sent the contamination report. He says he'll need to talk to you, <selfname>."

On completed
    Say "I'll give you the next mission when you are level 53."
